    "cursorSync": "Off",
    "description": "Where and when people report UFOs to the National UFO Reporting Center, 1906 to 2014: a map, the years, the hour, the day of the week and the day of the year, brushed together. July 4th is the top day of the year. Built by Grafana Assistant from a prompt, its figures checked with SQL.",
